==Match==

===Summary===
This match, like a number of other matches at this tournament, started at nine o'clock in the evening, because July daily high temperatures in the south-western Spanish city of Seville averaged {{convert|37|C|F}}; the hot weather during the tournament had already taken a toll on the players.{{citation needed|date=October 2019}} The day of the match had been very hot- it had hit {{convert|96.8|F|C|disp=flip}} by 18:30 and the temperature at 21:00 was still {{convert|90|F|C|disp=flip}}.<ref name="pears" /><ref>{{cite web | url=https://weatherspark.com/h/d/34152/1982/7/8/Historical-Weather-on-Thursday-July-8-1982-in-Sevilla-Spain | title=Sevilla July 8, 1982 Historical Weather (Spain) - Weather Spark }}</ref>

